{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0096","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000001ca:text","row":20053,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"冬子は相変わらず教室でぼんやりしていた。","en":"Touko sits in the classroom as usual, staring blankly into space.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006709","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00001","en":"Touko, ever unchanging, was sitting vacantly in the classroom.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:0000020a:text","row":20054,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"誰と話すでもない。","en":"She is not talking to anyone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006710","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00002","en":"She has no one to talk to,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","logical_relation"],"assessment":"誰と話すでもない says that she is not talking to anyone. 'She has no one to talk to' changes her present action into a claim that no conversational partner is available.","remedy":"Use 'She isn't talking to anyone.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":26,"start":0,"text":"She has no one to talk to,"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000234:text","row":20055,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"部活に参加するでもない。","en":"She is not participating in club activities.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006711","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00003","en":"no club activities to join,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","logical_relation"],"assessment":"部活に参加するでもない says that she is not participating in club activities. 'No club activities to join' instead claims the activities do not exist.","remedy":"Use 'Nor is she taking part in any club activities.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":27,"start":0,"text":"no club activities to join,"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000264:text","row":20056,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"目的もなく、ただそこにいる。","en":"She is simply there, with no purpose at all.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006712","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00004","en":"no objective either, she just stays there.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000002a0:text","row":20057,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006713","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00005","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000002c0:text","row":20058,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"正しい。","en":"That is right.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006714","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00006","en":"It's correct.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000002e0:text","row":20059,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"人としてはまっとうだ。","en":"It is the normal human thing to do.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006715","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00007","en":"For a person this is proper.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:0000030e:text","row":20060,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"突然、すべてがなくなったんだ。","en":"Everything vanished without warning.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006716","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00008","en":"All had vanished, suddenly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000344:text","row":20061,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"慣性をもって自らの動力とするしかない。","en":"All she can do is let inertia carry her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006717","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00009","en":"There's no point denying that the only motive power left inside is inertia.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The source says that the only option is to use inertia as one's own motive power. 'There's no point denying' adds a rejected act and recasts necessity as an argument about acknowledgment.","remedy":"Use 'All one can do is turn inertia into one's motive power.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":75,"start":0,"text":"There's no point denying that the only motive power left inside is inertia."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000382:text","row":20062,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"考えれば皮肉なものだった。","en":"When I think about it, there is an irony to that.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006718","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00010","en":"Thinking about it, that was ironic.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000003b4:text","row":20063,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"まともな人間たちが全員そろって滅び去り、俺たちだけが生き残った。","en":"All the normal people were wiped out together, leaving only us alive.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006719","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00011","en":"All normal people have perished, all hands lost, and only we have survived.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","register_voice"],"assessment":"The source says that every normal person perished. 'All hands lost' adds a maritime idiom and repeats the loss in a register absent from the line.","remedy":"Remove 'all hands lost.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":75,"start":0,"text":"All normal people have perished, all hands lost, and only we have survived."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000414:text","row":20064,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「桐原」","en":"“Kirihara.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006720","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00012","en":"Taichi: \"Kirihara.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:0000043c:text","row":20065,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006721","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00013","en":"Touko: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:0000045c:text","row":20066,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"ふむん。","en":"Hmmph.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006722","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00014","en":"Huu-hum.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000484:text","row":20067,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「ダイアローグ」","en":"“Dialogue.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006723","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00015","en":"Taichi: \"Dialogue.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000004d1:text","row":20068,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「？」","en":"“?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006724","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00016","en":"Touko: \"?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000004ef:text","row":20069,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"一瞬怪訝な顔をするが、すぐに思索の檻に閉じこもる（フリをする）。","en":"For a moment, she looks puzzled. Then she retreats into the cage of contemplation again—or pretends to.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006725","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00017","en":"Her face stood puzzled but an instant, then immediately secluded itself in the gaol of speculation (i.e. she's pretending).","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:0000054f:text","row":20070,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「ダイアローグ！」","en":"“Dialogue!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00018","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Dialogue!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000579:text","row":20071,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"ゾンビのように言う。","en":"I say it like a zombie.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006726","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00019","en":"So I say as if a zombie.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000005ad:text","row":20072,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「ダイアローグ、ダイアローグ」","en":"“Dialogue, dialogue.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006727","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Dialogue, dialogue.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000005eb:text","row":20073,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「ダイアローグ！」","en":"“Dialogue!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00021","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00021","en":"Taichi: \"Dialogue!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:0000063a:text","row":20074,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんなのよもーっ！」","en":"“What do you want?!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006728","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00022","en":"Touko: \"What's it even now!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","register_voice"],"assessment":"なんなのよもう is an exasperated 'What is it already?!' 'What's it even now' is not grammatical English and does not reproduce the complaint naturally.","remedy":"Use 'What is it already?!'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":0,"text":"Touko: \"What's it even now!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000668:text","row":20075,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"対話の怪物。","en":"A monster of dialogue.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006729","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00023","en":"A monster of dialogue.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:0000068c:text","row":20076,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"いや、怪物的な対話。","en":"No—a monstrous dialogue.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006730","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00024","en":"No, a monstrous dialogue.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000006b8:text","row":20077,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"……にゅ？","en":"...Nyu?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006731","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00025","en":"...whyat?","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","presentation"],"assessment":"にゅ is a deliberately odd vocalization, not the English interrogative 'what' distorted as 'whyat.' The translation invents a lexical pun.","remedy":"Use a consistent sound rendering such as '...nyu?'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":9,"start":0,"text":"...whyat?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000006da:text","row":20078,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"まあいい。","en":"Well, never mind.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006732","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00026","en":"Ah, who cares.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000704:text","row":20079,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「会話会話。対話対話。必要必要」","en":"“Conversation, conversation. Dialogue, dialogue. Necessary, necessary.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006733","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00027","en":"Taichi: \"Conversation Conversation. Dialogue Dialogue. Needed Needed!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:0000073c:text","row":20080,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"身振りをまじえて力説する。","en":"I argue passionately, gestures and all.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006734","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00028","en":"With major gesticulation mixed in for emphasis.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","omission"],"assessment":"The source says the narrator argues emphatically while mixing in gestures. The English is a verbless prepositional fragment and omits the act of arguing.","remedy":"Use 'I make my case emphatically, gestures and all.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":47,"start":0,"text":"With major gesticulation mixed in for emphasis."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000793:text","row":20081,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「……必要ない」","en":"“...It isn’t necessary.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006735","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00029","en":"Taichi: \"...unneeded.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","presentation"],"assessment":"The Japanese speaker metadata identifies Tōko as the speaker of '...No need.' The English labels the line as Taichi, assigning the reply to the wrong character.","remedy":"Attribute the line to Tōko.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":22,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"...unneeded.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000007c3:text","row":20082,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「対話なくして成立しないのだぞ」","en":"“It doesn’t work without dialogue.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006736","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00030","en":"Taichi: \"Without dialogue you don't even come to exist!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"対話なくして成立しない says that the relevant relationship or situation cannot be sustained without dialogue. 'You don't even come to exist' makes the addressee's literal existence depend on it.","remedy":"Use 'This can't work without dialogue.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":56,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"Without dialogue you don't even come to exist!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000820:text","row":20083,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「……よくわかんない」","en":"“...I don’t really get it.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006737","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00031","en":"Touko: \"...I don't really get it.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000873:text","row":20084,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「話しかけないでよ」","en":"“Don’t talk to me.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006738","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00032","en":"Touko: \"Stay back and do not talk to me!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","register_voice"],"assessment":"The source says only 'Don't talk to me.' 'Stay back' adds a demand for physical distance.","remedy":"Use 'Don't talk to me.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":41,"start":0,"text":"Touko: \"Stay back and do not talk to me!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000008c4:text","row":20085,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「あんたは私のことなんて、どうだっていいんでしょ！」","en":"“You don’t care about me anyway!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006739","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00033","en":"Touko: \"Besides, you just treat me like I don't matter!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000918:text","row":20086,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「そんなことないよ」","en":"“That’s not true.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006740","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00034","en":"Taichi: \"That's not true!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:0000094c:text","row":20087,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「キレイな桐原は好きさ」","en":"“I like pretty Kirihara.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006741","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00035","en":"Taichi: \"I like clean purty Kirhara.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","typography"],"assessment":"キレイ means pretty or beautiful here, not physically clean. The surname is also misspelled as 'Kirhara.'","remedy":"Use 'I like pretty Kirihara.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":37,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"I like clean purty Kirhara.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000009a1:text","row":20088,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「アレが！　好きな相手にすることっ！？」","en":"“Is that how you treat someone you like?!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006742","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00036","en":"Touko: \"There we go! You just want to be around someone you like, now?!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The source challenges the preceding conduct: 'That's what you do to someone you like?!' The English instead claims that he now wants to be around someone he likes, replacing the accusation entirely.","remedy":"Use 'That's what you do to someone you like?!'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":72,"start":0,"text":"Touko: \"There we go! You just want to be around someone you like, now?!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:000009e9:text","row":20089,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「そう」","en":"“Yeah.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006743","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00037","en":"Taichi: \"Yep.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000a2e:text","row":20090,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「ウソ！」","en":"“Liar!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006744","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00038","en":"Touko: \"Lies!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000a58:text","row":20091,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「ホント」","en":"“It’s true.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006745","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00039","en":"Taichi: \"Truth.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000a9f:text","row":20092,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって、だってだって……」","en":"“B-but, but, but...”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006746","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00040","en":"Touko: \"But, but but...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000ad3:text","row":20093,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"言葉に詰まる。","en":"Words fail her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006747","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00041","en":"At a loss for words.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000b1e:text","row":20094,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「話しかけないで」","en":"“Don’t talk to me.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006748","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00042","en":"Touko: \"Stay back and do not talk to me.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000b48:text","row":20095,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"まくしたてるのをやめたらしい。","en":"She seems to have stopped rattling on.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006749","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00043","en":"Seems the volcano of words has fizzled.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000b7e:text","row":20096,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"不完全燃焼。","en":"A disappointing fizzle.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006750","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00044","en":"Combustion incomplete.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000ba2:text","row":20097,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"話しかけないでと辛口に言われると、話しかけたくなる。","en":"When she snaps at me not to talk to her, it only makes me want to.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006751","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00045","en":"When I'm told in harsh tones not to approach or talk, I end up wanting to get close and talk.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition"],"assessment":"話しかける means to speak to someone. The English repeatedly adds physical approach and closeness not stated in the source.","remedy":"Use 'When I'm sharply told not to talk to her, it makes me want to talk to her.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":93,"start":0,"text":"When I'm told in harsh tones not to approach or talk, I end up wanting to get close and talk."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000bee:text","row":20098,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"話しかけると、また、話しかけないでと辛口に言われる。","en":"If I talk to her, she’ll snap at me again and tell me not to.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006752","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00046","en":"I get close and talk to her, but once more she harshly tells me to stay away and not to talk to her.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition"],"assessment":"The source describes speaking to her and being told again not to. 'Get close' and 'stay away' add a separate physical-distance exchange.","remedy":"Use 'When I do talk to her, she sharply tells me again not to.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":100,"start":0,"text":"I get close and talk to her, but once more she harshly tells me to stay away and not to talk to her."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000c42:text","row":20099,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「うーむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006753","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0010a:00047","en":"Taichi: \"Hmmm-mh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000c8c:choice:01","row":20100,"ordinal":48,"kind":"choice","jp":"話しかける","en":"Talk to her","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0096:00000c8c:choice:02","row":20101,"ordinal":49,"kind":"choice","jp":"部活に行く","en":"Go to club","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
